  data: {
    LLM: "Check for 49/50 immediately. A starting hand of five face cards/10s is rare but instantly ends the game.\n\nThe Drop Threshold: Since face cards are 10, hand totals are high. If you have under 15 points early in the game, it is usually safe to 'Drop' and take the pot.\n\nDefensive Tunk: If you see a player has won the Flip and Flop stakes, they are 'freerolling' the Game pot. Play aggressively to Tunk out or Drop early to prevent them from sweeping the table and taking all three pots.",
